+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+No decision on a transport compression codec is currently recorded for this project. The project's recorded architecture decisions cover the wire (serialization) format, TLS backend, and other transport-adjacent concerns, but none of them selects or revises a compression codec, so no current codec choice can be stated here.
